OL,5,G0045 The World at War
OL,6,     FOccupation: Hear how the
OL,7,     FNetherlands lived under Nazi rule
OL,8,     Ffor four years and how its people
OL,9,     Fdecided where their loyalties lay.
OL,10,     FNarrated by the late, great
OL,11,     FLaurence Olivier.
OL,12,G0145 The World at War
OL,13,     FPincers: Laurence Olivier provides
OL,14,     Fthe narration to this World War II
OL,15,     Fretrospective. Hear how 1944 saw
OL,16,     Fthe steady disintegration of the
OL,17,     FGerman war machine, as the Allies
OL,18,     Fadvanced.
