OL,5,G0250 Great British Railway Journeys
OL,6,     FBelfast to Portrush: On a journey
OL,7,     Ffrom Belfast to Portrush, Michael
OL,8,     FPortillo investigates the work of
OL,9,     Fauthor and Narnia creator CS
OL,10,     FLewis, and visits the Royal
OL,11,     FPortrush Golf Club.
OL,12,G0315 Great British Railway Journeys
OL,13,     FLarne to Dumfries: Michael
OL,14,     FPortillo journeys from Northern
OL,15,     FIreland across the water to
OL,16,     FScotland. Leaving from the seaport
OL,17,     Fof Larne, he reaches Stranraer and
OL,18,     Fthe Mull of Galloway.
